@startuml ImportRulesJson

title ルールJSONインポート機能（1フェーズ設計）

box "Rules Page - UI" #LightBlue
  participant "ImportButton" as ImportBtn
  participant "ImportRulesJsonUI" as ImportUI
  participant "RulesApp" as View
  participant "useImportRulesJson\n(Hook)" as Hook
  participant "ToastNotification" as Toast
end box

box "interface-adapters" #LightGreen
  participant "<<interface>>\nIImportRulesJson\nControllerFactory" as IFactory
  participant "ImportRulesJson\nControllerFactory" as Factory
  participant "<<anonymous impl>>\nIImportRulesJson\nController" as Controller
end box

box "application-business-rules" #LightYellow
  participant "<<anonymous impl>>\nIImportRulesJson\nPresenter" as Presenter
  participant "ImportRulesJson\nInputData" as InputData
  participant "ImportRulesJson\nInteractor\n(IImportRulesJsonUseCase)" as Interactor
  participant "<<interface>>\nIJsonParser" as IJsonParser
  participant "<<interface>>\nIFileTextReader" as IFileTextReader
  participant "<<interface>>\nIRewriteRule\nRepository" as IRepository
  participant "ImportRulesJson\nOutputData" as OutputData
  participant "ImportRulesJson\nErrorOutputData" as ErrorOutputData
end box

box "enterprise-business-rules" #LightPink
  participant "ImportFileSize" as FileSize
  participant "RulesJsonVersionSchema" as VersionSchema
  participant "ImportRulesCollection" as RulesCollection
  participant "RewriteRule\n.fromParams" as RewriteRule
end box

box "frameworks-and-drivers" #LightCyan
  participant "FileTextReader" as FileTextReader
  participant "JsonParser" as JsonParser
  participant "DexieRewriteRule\nRepository" as DexieRepo
end box

== 初期化（useMemo 内） ==

View -> Hook : useImportRulesJson(onRulesChanged)
activate Hook

note right of Hook
  useMemo で 1 回だけ factory.create() を呼ぶ
  onSuccess / onError コールバックを注入する
end note

Hook -> IFactory : create(onSuccess, onError)
activate IFactory
IFactory -> Factory : create(onSuccess, onError)
activate Factory

Factory -> Presenter : 無名オブジェクト生成\n{ present, presentError }
Factory -> Interactor : new(repository, presenter,\n  jsonParser, fileTextReader)
Factory --> IFactory : 無名 IImportRulesJsonController\n{ importRulesJson(file) }
deactivate Factory
IFactory --> Hook : controller
deactivate IFactory

Hook --> View : { handleFileSelect, isImporting,\n  importError, importSuccess,\n  dismissImportError,\n  dismissImportSuccess }

note right of Hook
  ADR-005: Factoryパターンで React コールバックを
  Presenter（無名実装）に注入する
  onSuccess → setIsImporting(false) + setImportSuccess + onRulesChanged()
  onError   → setIsImporting(false) + setImportError
end note
deactivate Hook

== ファイル選択 → バリデーション → 一括置換（1フェーズ） ==

ImportBtn -> ImportUI : onFileSelect(file)
activate ImportUI
note over ImportBtn
  hidden <input type="file" accept=".json">
  同一ファイル再選択のため onChange 後に value をリセット
end note

ImportUI -> View : onImportClick(file)
activate View

View -> Hook : handleFileSelect(file)
activate Hook

Hook -> Hook : setImportError(null)\nsetImportSuccess(null)\nsetIsImporting(true)

Hook -> Controller : importRulesJson(file)
activate Controller

Controller -> InputData : new ImportRulesJsonInputData(file)
Controller -> Interactor : importRulesJson(inputData)
activate Interactor

note over Interactor
  try { 下記 A〜F を順に実行 } catch(error) {
    presenter.presentError(ImportRulesJsonErrorOutputData.fromError(error))
  }
  各ステップの throw は即座に catch に分岐する
end note

== A. ファイルサイズ検証（EBR VO） ==
Interactor -> FileSize : new ImportFileSize(inputData.file.size)
note right of FileSize
  コンストラクタで 5MB 超過を検査
  超過時: ImportFileSizeError を throw
end note

== B. テキスト読み取り（F&D 経由） ==
Interactor -> IFileTextReader : readAsText(inputData.file)
activate IFileTextReader
IFileTextReader -> FileTextReader : readAsText(file)
activate FileTextReader
FileTextReader --> IFileTextReader : Promise<string>
deactivate FileTextReader
IFileTextReader --> Interactor : jsonString
deactivate IFileTextReader

== C. JSON 解析（F&D 経由） ==
Interactor -> IJsonParser : parseAsObject(jsonString)
activate IJsonParser
IJsonParser -> JsonParser : parseAsObject(jsonString)
activate JsonParser
note right of JsonParser
  JSON.parse 後に型検査
  構文不正: JsonSyntaxError を throw
  非オブジェクト/配列/null: JsonStructureError を throw
end note
JsonParser --> IJsonParser : Record<string, unknown>
deactivate JsonParser
IJsonParser --> Interactor : parsed
deactivate IJsonParser

== D. スキーマ／バージョン検証（EBR VO） ==
Interactor -> VersionSchema : new RulesJsonVersionSchema(parsed)
note right of VersionSchema
  version/rules 欠落: InvalidRulesJsonSchemaError を throw
  version != "1.0": UnsupportedRulesJsonVersionError を throw
end note

== E. ルール集合の検証（EBR VO + Entity） ==
Interactor -> RulesCollection : new ImportRulesCollection(parsed.rules)
activate RulesCollection
note right of RulesCollection
  0件: EmptyRulesCollectionError を throw
  >1000件: RulesCollectionCountExceededError を throw
end note

loop 各 rawRule
  RulesCollection -> RewriteRule : fromParams(raw.id, raw)
  RewriteRule --> RulesCollection : RewriteRule
  note right of RewriteRule
    不正 id: InvalidRuleIdError を throw
  end note
end

RulesCollection --> Interactor : collection
deactivate RulesCollection

Interactor -> RulesCollection : toArray()
RulesCollection --> Interactor : validatedRules: RewriteRule[]

== F. 原子的一括置換 ==
Interactor -> IRepository : replaceAll(validatedRules)
activate IRepository
IRepository -> DexieRepo : replaceAll(rules)
activate DexieRepo
note right of DexieRepo
  Dexie.transaction('rw') 内で
  clear() → bulkAdd() を原子的に実行
  失敗時は自動ロールバック（storage 例外）
end note
DexieRepo --> IRepository : Promise<void>
deactivate DexieRepo
IRepository --> Interactor : 完了
deactivate IRepository

== 通知（try の末尾 or catch 節） ==

alt 正常完了（A〜F すべて throw なし）
  Interactor -> OutputData : new(validatedRules.length)
  OutputData --> Interactor : outputData

  Interactor -> Presenter : present(outputData)
  activate Presenter
  Presenter -> Hook : onSuccess(`${importedCount}件のルールをインポートしました`)
  note right of Hook
    setIsImporting(false)
    setImportSuccess(msg)
    onRulesChangedRef.current()  // 一覧再取得
  end note
  Hook -> Toast : 成功トースト表示（props 経由）
  Toast --> Hook : 表示
  Presenter --> Interactor : void
  deactivate Presenter

else いずれかの段で例外が throw
  Interactor -> ErrorOutputData : fromError(error)
  activate ErrorOutputData
  note right of ErrorOutputData
    Strategy Map により errorType を決定
    parse / validation / storage の 3 種
    マップ未登録のエラーは StorageImportError でラップ
  end note
  ErrorOutputData --> Interactor : errorOutputData
  deactivate ErrorOutputData

  Interactor -> Presenter : presentError(errorOutputData)
  activate Presenter
  Presenter -> Hook : onError(errorOutputData.message)
  note right of Hook
    setIsImporting(false)
    setImportError(msg)
  end note
  Hook -> Toast : エラートースト表示（props 経由）
  Toast --> Hook : 表示
  Presenter --> Interactor : void
  deactivate Presenter
end

Interactor --> Controller : Promise<void>
deactivate Interactor
Controller --> Hook : Promise<void>
deactivate Controller

note right of Hook
  handleFileSelect 側の try/catch は防御的ガード
  Interactor は内部で catch → presenter.presentError に委譲するため
  通常このパスで例外が伝搬することはない
end note

Hook --> View : state 更新
deactivate Hook
View --> ImportUI : props 更新（isImporting / importError / importSuccess）
deactivate View
ImportUI --> ImportBtn : ImportButton.disabled 反映
deactivate ImportUI

== トースト閉じる ==

ImportUI -> Hook : dismissImportError() / dismissImportSuccess()
activate Hook
Hook -> Hook : setImportError(null) / setImportSuccess(null)
deactivate Hook

@enduml
